    "font size" : 10.909,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Proof. We consider the related FCFS system, and denote the variables related to this system with a superscript FCFS. Remark that the waiting time of a tagged customer under the FCFS model is given by the sum of: (i) the travel time, T, to the tagged customer; (ii) the residual service time of the customer in service, if any, at the arrival instant of the tagged customer; (iii) the service time of all waiting customers present at the time of arrival and (iv) the service time of all customers arriving in the same batch, who are served before the tagged customer. Hence:"
  }, {
